#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:5
#: 6451222072454e6b925ab5736f44a363 8dfa1d1d7e3849728de52650d428c231
#: a0ec68aa761044878f86fac682215066 fa10590ca7d94308a323b11f98f58cc7
msgid "Pre-Arm Safety Checks"
msgstr "解锁前安全检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:7
#: 4936cec25e144bcb837cda8c0ce3f956 56a0834f94d14a34b4f2064580837389
#: 57cf47ec432a4cd8a3bb3e14a76be287 aeaf5421e4ca43a0b364c83a583b2009
msgid ""
"ArduPilot includes a suite of Pre-arm Safety Checks which will prevent the "
"vehicle from arming its propulsion system if any of a fairly large number of"
" issues are discovered before movement including missed calibration, "
"configuration or bad sensor data. These checks help prevent crashes or fly-"
"aways but some can also be disabled if necessary."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot "
"包含一套解锁前安全检查，若在运动前发现大量问题（包括未完成校准、配置错误或传感器数据异常），将阻止飞行器解锁推进系统。这些检查有助于防止坠机或飞走，但如有必要也可以禁用部分检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:16
#: 3ee179c0ac534cd680115ea7149dc478 6d11262c55f9412d8eebd96e00139e33
#: a77e42324a034487a6f92bdea544d12c b1d99afed4db454ab57bdfafc1594d31
msgid ""
"Never disable the arming checks (ie :ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` not = "
"\"1\", except for bench testing. Always resolve any prearm or arming "
"failures BEFORE attempting to fly. Doing otherwise may result in the loss of"
" the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"除桌面测试外，切勿禁用解锁检查（即 :ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` 不应 = 「1」）。请在尝试飞行之前 "
"**始终** 解决任何解锁前或解锁失败问题，否则可能导致飞行器损失。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:19
#: 1cf89d123a7b4ba8825dfa58b449eef3 68b765ab7ed84602afa4e87aa09c3ca5
#: a903c88c20dd4f25bca9ee114fd7f4d0 fccef1bc0c5548e4a1c356b726ced760
msgid "Recognising which Pre-Arm Check has failed using the GCS"
msgstr "通过地面站识别哪项解锁前检查失败"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:21
#: 8b89785307514fad8be33d247f8a3427 9a154bbbe7a945edbb96dda284f253ea
#: e94763c56bf9477da3b7965c9721a501 ec388486d38a4c4da618b07f643c77cc
msgid ""
"The pilot will notice a pre-arm check failure because he/she will be unable "
"to arm the vehicle and the notification LED, if available, will be flashing "
"yellow.  To determine exactly which check has failed:"
msgstr "飞手会注意到解锁前检查失败，因为无法解锁飞行器，且通知 LED（若有）将闪烁黄色。要确定具体哪项检查失败："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:25
#: 04662e47373d426b87063d41fbeb3a7d 3ed0754793684f7d9291d301f04d4562
#: aea00f0453194843b55a50ec25f8a8a6 bd7d3ac7d6d64d7883cb830307859930
msgid ""
"Connect the Autopilot to the ground station using a USB cable or "
":ref:`Telemetry <common-telemetry-landingpage>`."
msgstr "使用 USB 线缆或 :ref:`数传 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` 将飞控连接到地面站。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:27
#: 174618e985c847f490623558f58ae43d 25441b016eea445f9ef64d9d732df296
#: e76c032dedec47b6b581f633475b8eea f712cfa9c2cf45448bbf10902b8f0f70
msgid ""
"Ensure the GCS is connected to the vehicle (i.e. on Mission Planner and push"
" the \"Connect\" button on the upper right)."
msgstr "确保地面站已连接到飞行器（例如在 Mission Planner 中点击右上角的「连接」按钮）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:29
#: 365258260a6244f98700ed6951da53f5 57f17b94e5be4e0d9a4a4850e34e9f52
#: 8c284904fd144d38a2330c67ac10a371 df96f5fc47234b10ac5ec03e923a4f48
msgid ""
"Turn on your radio transmitter and attempt to arm the vehicle (regular "
"procedure is using throttle down, yaw right or via an RCx_OPTION switch)"
msgstr "打开遥控器并尝试解锁飞行器（常规操作是油门最低、偏航向右，或通过 RCx_OPTION 开关）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:31
#: 3b824d95c3c140cea682613b4ba2477f 92475090c82842868ae006f9cd1513fa
#: e57d42d322234460b2d91c216368d9c5 f854f85192db447ba25c52d4188ae1f9
msgid ""
"The first cause of the Pre-Arm Check failure will be displayed in red on the"
" HUD window"
msgstr "解锁前检查失败的首个原因将在 HUD 窗口以红色显示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:34
#: 5bb1b4e8ee1b4bc6b83d6c5cb3441415 6035089f08e74321bb3525cad92e165e
#: b719a3251a8e4f10a1b93074b44c942b d1864b7098e14bf19e8cbc492a310471
msgid ""
"Pre-arm checks that are failing will also be sent as messages to the GCS "
"while disarmed, about every 30 seconds. If you wish to disable this and have"
" them sent only when an attempt arm fails, then set the "
":ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` bit 1 (value 1)."
msgstr ""
"检查失败的解锁前检查项也会在上锁状态下约每 30 秒发送一次消息到地面站。若希望禁用此功能而仅在解锁尝试失败时才发送，请设置 "
":ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` 第 1 位（值为 1）。"

