#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:233
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:269
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:287
#: 0aa9045b8b0e4975853617930e87a31b 2045cb0f0da044928f939bc9df592434
#: 95d50046ea234684959d5b8d34bcd56b e61a4997598343e199851be12e092d57
msgid "Barometer failures:"
msgstr "气压计故障："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:235
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:271
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:289
#: 4168cdf307904da2a90a06589ef2a194 9d81c0f72c9243e6ac79dd57d75a987a
#: d7b1b2003ea7478bb7ab5f80cb00d467 ed2ed5295d284d42a2db80852a0d1136
msgid ""
"**Baro not healthy** : the barometer sensor is reporting that it is "
"unhealthy which is normally a sign of a hardware failure."
msgstr "**Baro not healthy**：气压计传感器报告异常，通常表示硬件故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:238
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:274
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:292
#: 77e225b134e9402da4ffe8b5f97ab478 92ef5eee192b41a88a8c82d52c67ec7f
#: d72bb2b67c694d96aaadc0ee43e57321 e386a78638b948d8a5cd351f71b78551
msgid ""
"**Alt disparity** : the barometer altitude disagrees with the inertial "
"navigation (i.e. Baro + Accelerometer) altitude estimate by more than 1 "
"meters.  This message is normally short-lived and can occur when the "
"autopilot is first plugged in or if it receives a hard jolt (i.e. dropped "
"suddenly).  If it does not clear the :ref:`accelerometers may need to be "
"calibrated <common-accelerometer-calibration>` or there may be a barometer "
"hardware issue."
msgstr ""
"**Alt disparity**：气压计高度与惯性导航（即气压计 + 加速度计）估算高度相差 1 "
"米以上。此消息通常短暂出现，可能在飞控刚接通电源或受到强烈冲击时出现。若持续存在，可能需要 :ref:`重新校准加速度计 <common-"
"accelerometer-calibration>`，或存在气压计硬件问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:246
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:282
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:300
#: 242ee1abd79a471b92b119438b953435 2bb3aa4f783d4b0a9387cc1cd4ee8f90
#: 481f08f385184f29bd01b3b647fa2301 704fa0f526514b48bb5b23f5b1202fd0
msgid "Compass failures:"
msgstr "罗盘故障："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:248
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:284
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:302
#: 7fb906fa5e3e4559b005caa6dd9bf175 81960ce9b6e84495b33b686cb415b863
#: 8cb2d6eae2f448f583c966ebf6f0749b a6f51adcabcb47b499c5016fc56ff874
msgid ""
"**Compass not healthy** : the compass sensor is reporting that it is "
"unhealthy which is a sign of a hardware failure."
msgstr "**Compass not healthy**：罗盘传感器报告异常，表示硬件故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:251
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:287
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:305
#: 47fd9363fe744e008a8a981631286710 4b9564cc9fe64c319146c90ea56b6419
#: 5f288d1be60d4afa9965fad570cd0500 a9e20938eec244799c7dac79d053f0f4
msgid ""
"**Compass not calibrated** : the :ref:`compass(es) has not been calibrated "
"<common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>`.  the ``COMPASS_OFS_X, _Y, "
"_Z`` parameters are zero or the number or type of compasses connected has "
"been changed since the last compass calibration was performed."
msgstr ""
"**Compass not calibrated**：:ref:`罗盘尚未校准 <common-compass-calibration-in-"
"mission-planner>`。``COMPASS_OFS_X, _Y, _Z`` 参数为零，或自上次罗盘校准以来连接的罗盘数量或类型已发生变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:256
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:292
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:310
#: 2d7a936148d342ebbaa0909e72f7f247 4aca37541dc84b2f9be949c18d54b29a
#: 6f0f156e7d034c9faa53e1cb3a2f1c8c 742c6e0073324b48b2d75f2b2ab6ed47
msgid ""
"**Compass offsets too high** : the primary compass's offsets length (i.e. "
"sqrt(x^2+y^2+z^2)) are larger than 500.  This can be caused by metal objects"
" being placed too close to the compass.  If only an internal compass is "
"being used (not recommended), it may simply be the metal in the board that "
"is causing the large offsets and this may not actually be a problem in which"
" case you may wish to disable the compass check."
msgstr ""
"**Compass offsets too high**：主罗盘偏移量长度（即 sqrt(x^2+y^2+z^2)）大于 "
"500。这可能是由于金属物体距罗盘太近所致。如果只使用内置罗盘（不推荐），偏移量过大可能仅仅是电路板上的金属所致，这实际上可能不是问题，此时您可能希望禁用罗盘检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:264
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:300
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:318
#: 0e344bbc7b1a4aa0b5b9354b02b43305 15370fe258994c6da9c526fc0c0aa23d
#: 4c52bbc391a14452b0918d93165bc5cf a4330bfd3d1e438498b0d42b405ae710
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"**Check mag field** : This can result from failing two different checks. "
"First, the sensed magnetic field in the area is 35% higher or  lower than "
"the expected value.  The expected length is 530 so it's > 874 or < 185. "
"Also, besides this rough check, when the vehicle's position has been "
"obtained (GPS lock), another check against the field strength predicted "
"using the internal World Magnetic Field database is done with much tighter "
"limits. If you are failing this, either the :ref:`compass calibration "
"<common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>` has not calculated good "
"offsets and calibration should be repeated, or your vehicle is near a large "
"metallic or magnetic disturbance and will need to be relocated."
msgstr ""
"**Check mag field**：此问题可能由两种不同的检查失败引起。首先，传感器探测到的磁场强度比预期值高或低 35% 以上（预期长度为 "
"530，即 > 874 或 < 185）。此外，在获取飞行器位置（GPS "
"锁定）后，还会使用内置世界磁场数据库对磁场强度进行更严格的对比检查。如果此项检查失败，可能是 :ref:`罗盘校准 <common-compass-"
"calibration-in-mission-planner>` 计算的偏移量不佳需要重新校准，或飞行器附近存在大型金属或磁性干扰物需要移位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:268
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:304
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:322
#: 393e51b1fc9a495da796afd2fa63236f 856c04636f8749188fabbdaed728fa53
#: ed5764a4c0ef4c01ac410f567d50cb22 f4fc9731bd664e72b18f722364d99ed9
msgid ""
"**Compasses inconsistent** : the internal and external compasses are "
"pointing in different directions (off by >45 degrees).  This is normally "
"caused by the external compasses orientation (i.e. "
":ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` parameter) being set incorrectly."
msgstr ""
"**Compasses inconsistent**：内部罗盘与外部罗盘指向不同方向（偏差 >45 度）。通常是因为外部罗盘的安装方向（即 "
":ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` 参数）设置不正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:274
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:310
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:328
#: 2b55cc4c84d644fa9671a55cae7dbf56 72ea968c715d42a0a125add5493b2490
#: a08a0032df564e2a8b768937ccee94bc c13a4f83ae9f48feb7963cf013f979c8
msgid "GPS related failures:"
msgstr "GPS 相关故障："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:276
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:312
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:330
#: 44a9ad2ac0a541d3be435dea421d5b20 61c720794d78427cad59b259d75b67a8
#: a54d8d5132ec406bab0643f4190491ef b8e6c6a639774136972e68f298ab982a
msgid ""
"**GPS Glitch** : the :ref:`GPS is glitching <gps-failsafe-glitch-"
"protection>` and the vehicle is in a flight mode that requires GPS (i.e. "
"Loiter, PosHold, etc) and/or the :ref:`cylindrical fence <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"**GPS Glitch**：:ref:`GPS 信号异常 <gps-failsafe-glitch-protection>`，且飞行器处于需要 GPS"
" 的飞行模式（如 Loiter、PosHold 等），和/或已启用 :ref:`圆柱形电子围栏 <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:280
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:316
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:334
#: 07027683c0444e3aa73edf120123c11b 24df01ae2ecf4c09810089feb2796372
#: 94e395d1d17c47368f2f8a781be8b5c8 9928bc93d7484a48abdf0f3c9db43db6
msgid ""
"**Need 3D Fix** : the GPS does not have a 3D fix and the vehicle is in a "
"flight mode that requires the GPS and/or the :ref:`cylindrical fence "
"<common-ac2_simple_geofence>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"**Need 3D Fix**：GPS 未获得三维定位，且飞行器处于需要 GPS 的飞行模式，和/或已启用 :ref:`圆柱形电子围栏 <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:283
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:319
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:337
#: 5062dbab53ac4aff9e0d6f4a95b699c8 a4ed7d331e5b471ebdfc570e969889b9
#: b31a5f3f98f54da6a424168a61e74288 b7b741d4435d4ebbb429d71889d2b5c3
msgid ""
"**Bad Velocity** : the vehicle's velocity (according to inertial navigation "
"system) is above 50cm/s.  Issues that could lead to this include the vehicle"
" actually moving or being dropped, bad accelerometer calibration, GPS "
"updating at below the expected 5hz."
msgstr ""
"**Bad Velocity**：飞行器速度（由惯性导航系统计算）超过 50cm/s。可能原因包括飞行器实际移动或被抛动、加速度计校准不良、GPS "
"更新频率低于预期的 5Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:288
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:324
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:342
#: 03a299dac2e941a1bddb1a5f3367fddf 2b340fc69435490fafda8d73425e8ad3
#: aaab4e0134ae48f39b3c67c9f96e77fd d2b125ef0a874e34a0a92e80298eb907
msgid ""
"**High GPS HDOP** : the GPS's HDOP value (a measure of the position "
"accuracy) is above 2.0 and the vehicle is in a flight mode that requires GPS"
" and/or the :ref:`cylindrical fence <common-ac2_simple_geofence>` is "
"enabled. This may be resolved by simply waiting a few minutes, moving to a "
"location with a better view of the sky or checking sources of GPS "
"interference (i.e. FPV equipment) are moved further from the GPS. "
"Alternatively the check can be relaxed by increasing the "
":ref:`GPS_HDOP_GOOD<GPS_HDOP_GOOD>` parameter to 2.2 or 2.5.  Worst case the"
" pilot may disable the fence and take-off in a mode that does not require "
"the GPS (i.e. Stabilize, AltHold) and switch into Loiter after arming but "
"this is not recommended."
msgstr ""
"**High GPS HDOP**：GPS 的 HDOP 值（位置精度的衡量指标）超过 2.0，且飞行器处于需要 GPS 的飞行模式，和/或已启用 "
":ref:`圆柱形电子围栏 <common-ac2_simple_geofence>`。可以尝试等待几分钟、移至视野更开阔的地点，或将 FPV 设备等 "
"GPS 干扰源移至更远处来解决。也可以将 :ref:`GPS_HDOP_GOOD<GPS_HDOP_GOOD>` 参数增至 2.2 或 2.5 "
"来放宽限制。最坏的情况下，飞手可以禁用电子围栏并在不需要 GPS 的模式（如 Stabilize、AltHold）下解锁起飞，解锁后再切换至 "
"Loiter，但不推荐这样做。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:300
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:336
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:354
#: 46c42efad8914c1f88a68f5591f6e4b4 4fed9a790bff4e738235684c74e242ef
#: 9c3942f6362944ce9b72e554a2d9cfd4 a294111ae0cb46129d7218d116aaced6
msgid ""
"Note: the GPS HDOP can be readily viewed through the Mission Planner's Quick"
" tab as shown below."
msgstr "注意：GPS HDOP 值可在 Mission Planner 的「Quick」选项卡中直接查看，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:307
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:343
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:361
#: 27ba6f59dd394585ae46067556a8e07d 2da07629baf148caafeea2a5e0252eee
#: a5ad473d3bdd436585354242a4f314e2 dddc81f4976140baac368fb2f3855c97
msgid "INS checks (i.e. Acclerometer and Gyro checks):"
msgstr "INS 检查（即加速度计和陀螺仪检查）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:309
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:345
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:363
#: 5ee8bbe62c5c40d390b2cf601928f4c7 7844ce5cdcb94988921a66f7a21fcbec
#: 854f5ed31d314d7fbf7f7f8f7db2693b ae35cc25bd93455c92462d639fcec1c5
msgid ""
"**INS not calibrated**: some or all of the accelerometer's offsets are zero."
"  The :ref:`accelerometers need to be calibrated <common-accelerometer-"
"calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"**INS not calibrated**：部分或全部加速度计偏移量为零。需要 :ref:`校准加速度计 <common-accelerometer-"
"calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:312
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:348
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:366
#: 4d271c5164484501a08670914b436c35 b4dd69830e344599a70b12a540ff3dbb
#: cf4c67c46a5042c5813cf9b6e02e7e66 d13cea14ad6d4d7f91a935618dfdcee2
msgid ""
"**Accels not healthy**: one of the accelerometers is reporting it is not "
"healthy which could be a hardware issue.  This can also occur immediately "
"after a firmware update before the board has been restarted."
msgstr "**Accels not healthy**：某个加速度计报告状态不正常，可能是硬件问题。也可能在固件更新后、重启飞控板之前出现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:316
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:352
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:370
#: 0a0f4887aabb417f98c378ccb98e8525 394ce1f664b740f183263d5501c0c3ec
#: 8520f25856c74faebbb2a36113d29fce e508244e36e14435aac8f02fab6fd3c7
msgid ""
"**Accels inconsistent**: the accelerometers are reporting accelerations "
"which are different by at least 1m/s/s.  The :ref:`accelerometers need to be"
" re-calibrated <common-accelerometer-calibration>` or there is a hardware "
"issue."
msgstr ""
"**Accels inconsistent**：各加速度计测量的加速度差异达到至少 1m/s/s。需要 :ref:`重新校准加速度计 <common-"
"accelerometer-calibration>`，或存在硬件问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:320
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:356
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:374
#: 08d293d091ba4c09b5edae17aca292e7 1f74e5f55e1d4ca4938220f6d093bd46
#: 872feaffa44c4af8b0c2a0e488bb3d91 9d11fdb4ef5540dc9b1963737b4c647d
msgid ""
"**Gyros not healthy**: one of the gyroscopes is reporting it is unhealthy "
"which is likely a hardware issue.  This can also occur immediately after a "
"firmware update before the board has been restarted."
msgstr "**Gyros not healthy**：某个陀螺仪报告状态不正常，可能是硬件问题。也可能在固件更新后、重启飞控板之前出现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:324
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:360
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:378
#: 2452ae9d62ba4e5198bb957f10edd167 4843a69c44bf45a3800ee5e96cdc3198
#: 51c4644c751c4719b7cc440ba87a785e ff1a4094e41b4f0987d91ad5b1539492
msgid ""
"**Gyro cal failed**: the gyro calibration failed to capture offsets. This is"
" most often caused by the vehicle being moved during the gyro calibration "
"(when red and blue lights are flashing) in which case unplugging the battery"
" and plugging it in again while being careful not to jostle the vehicle will"
" likely resolve the issue.  Sensors hardware failures (i.e. spikes) can also"
" cause this failure."
msgstr ""
"**Gyro cal "
"failed**：陀螺仪校准未能采集偏移量。最常见原因是在陀螺仪校准期间（红蓝灯闪烁时）飞行器被移动，此时拔出电池重新插入（注意不要晃动飞行器）通常可以解决问题。传感器硬件故障（如信号尖刺）也可能导致此故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:331
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:367
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:385
#: 40eb327a9626456d9599a1cf2474a3cb 90421bd5cdb24e698e0742a20ff4609a
#: c84bf8ac2a5f4f3c86791b394b555b67 da297b3eb59249dd99864128b22ba397
msgid ""
"**Gyros inconsistent**: two gyroscopes are reporting vehicle rotation rates "
"that differ by more than 20deg/sec.  This is likely a hardware failure or "
"caused by a bad gyro calibration."
msgstr "**Gyros inconsistent**：两个陀螺仪测量的飞行器旋转速率相差超过 20deg/sec。可能是硬件故障或陀螺仪校准不良。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:336
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:372
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:390
#: 150ddc3c63ea40129b6ca50705c53c88 44ed11fb9f254ed29579ef1d98475145
#: 9f89918d940b4a25a9b27e4990827794 e2e6e7db420d41ffa5055b618589685a
msgid "Board Voltage checks:"
msgstr "主板电压检查："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:338
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:374
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:392
#: 2fff90d083b04b6487de8622e3e05815 7b952220bc7a4bf992b737e2311e2ff5
#: f9cce84746354042af4fa94561c837a2 febfa0f83f9a467dbec845183231a255
msgid ""
"**Check Board Voltage**: the board's internal voltage is below 4.3 Volts or "
"above 5.8 Volts."
msgstr "**Check Board Voltage**：主板内部电压低于 4.3V 或高于 5.8V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:341
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:377
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:395
#: 04913ec599e6437a9e4a9791cc54c578 79caf1527ff34bc19e4cb9ac401cba9c
#: c67b24c01c984b498f5a016cb8f2131b f800cb79271e49f2a815a19865497557
msgid ""
"If powered through a USB cable (i.e. while on the bench) this can be caused "
"by the desktop computer being unable to provide sufficient current to the "
"autopilot - try replacing the USB cable."
msgstr "如果通过 USB 线供电（如在桌面测试时），可能是计算机无法为飞控提供足够的电流——请尝试更换 USB 线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:345
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:381
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:399
#: 477a4e3b4db34cfca04e4a9afb3a895f 59b7815ac52d487cb7cb069e9125456b
#: 668b275c19ff4357bf2dd8777209183d c1e2e85759974e12a762d82396dc46d6
msgid ""
"If powered from a battery this is a serious problem and the power system "
"(i.e. Power Module, battery, etc) should be carefully checked before flying."
msgstr "如果通过电池供电，则属于严重问题，应在飞行前仔细检查供电系统（电源模块、电池等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:350
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:386
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:404
#: 386145a9602f469299ef1a73f8601be5 38b75301c54b4504805f1ec3ccb787d6
#: 540fb83543374a5489c650dcba84dcd3 5642a5d1fa2040cb9b257313f1d8fb39
msgid "Parameter checks:"
msgstr "参数检查："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:352
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:388
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:406
#: 339facd4227944a492399edad7090582 3e9b1b6afa3f49aa9079b62152c09aef
#: 556fb9cfc18c4c7f8dcd42735e6ea22b 780a4932e97d4227a2c9c6fba5813cd3
msgid ""
"**Ch7&Ch8 Opt cannot be same**: :ref:`Auxiliary Function Switches "
"<channel-7-and-8-options>` are set to the same option which is not permitted"
" because it could lead to confusion."
msgstr ""
"**Ch7&Ch8 Opt cannot be same**：:ref:`辅助功能开关 <channel-7-and-8-options>` "
"被设置为相同选项，这是不允许的，因为可能导致混乱。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:354
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:390
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:408
#: 3fed512d96bd41c7a98a02251e661ef5 654d458e3cd74520be0880d9a23100e9
#: 6dc4218d592c412da6f7ed8128ea5292 898f2107392940dcb766688c23616e06
msgid ""
"**Check FS_THR_VALUE**: the :ref:`radio failsafe pwm value <radio-failsafe>`"
" has been set too close to the throttle channels (i.e. ch3) minimum."
msgstr ""
"**Check FS_THR_VALUE**：:ref:`遥控失控保护 PWM 值 <radio-failsafe>` "
"与油门通道（ch3）最小值设置过于接近。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:356
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:392
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:410
#: 47935becb2a8474894d35c4f719c3270 59f1ccc0eed14785abb95fc38c6bd4bf
#: 6599fa3429f44eb18f3e1247002f8f33 7bc9856595fd45fd8907460c907c2a22
msgid ""
"**Check ANGLE_MAX**: the :ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` parameter which "
"controls the vehicle's maximum lean angle has been set below 10 degrees "
"(i.e. 1000) or above 80 degrees (i.e. 8000)."
msgstr ""
"**Check ANGLE_MAX**：控制飞行器最大倾斜角度的 :ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` 参数被设置为低于 10 度（即"
" 1000）或高于 80 度（即 8000）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:360
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:396
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:414
#: 0dd33e1b30c44945b688ac09c591211e 17275878d36b4196879596d358a8212d
#: 77eb33bb05444190bcb478cfc625e63d c42983a4f23b4459986413ce79c3ccb3
msgid ""
"**ACRO_BAL_ROLL/PITCH**: the :ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL<ACRO_BAL_ROLL>` parameter "
"is higher than the Stabilize Roll P and/or "
":ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH<ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` parameter is higher than the Stabilize"
" Pitch P value.  This could lead to the pilot being unable to control the "
"lean angle in ACRO mode because the :ref:`Acro Trainer stabilization <acro-"
"mode_acro_trainer>` would overpower the pilot's input."
msgstr ""
"**ACRO_BAL_ROLL/PITCH**：:ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL<ACRO_BAL_ROLL>` 参数高于 Stabilize "
"横滚 P 值，和/或 :ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH<ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` 参数高于 Stabilize 俯仰 P "
"值。这可能导致飞手在 Acro 模式下无法控制倾斜角度，因为 :ref:`Acro Trainer 稳定 <acro-"
"mode_acro_trainer>` 功能会覆盖飞手输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:367
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:403
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:421
#: 0ea5cdb502424041ba0609f473f921fe 8a6e4efdbe3b40a7952ed7d0a7f2fd04
#: a832aaa13dcc459bacd1b73ce1d4b64e da11519836044dec9a9926fa6905176f
msgid "Battery/Power Monitor:"
msgstr "电池/电源监测器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:369
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:405
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:423
#: 0a570dcfec6f4012845dfa645105f125 11a630c6d94f483eb5bc2e94135b2670
#: 32b07b9a2f014bfeb7169cd9dcf02728 7110000eac51489d9d6d7d87d7eafbdc
msgid ""
"If a power monitor voltage is below its failsafe low or critical voltages or"
" failsafe remaining capacity low or critical set points, this check will "
"fail and indicate which set point it is below. It will also fail if these "
"set points are inverted, ie critical point is higher than low point. See "
":ref:`failsafe-battery` for Copter, :ref:`apms-failsafe-function` for Plane,"
" or :ref:`rover-failsafes` for Rover for more information on these."
msgstr ""
"如果电源监测器电压低于其失控保护低电压或临界电压，或剩余容量低于失控保护低容量或临界容量设定值，此检查将失败并提示超出的设定点。若这些设定点顺序颠倒（即临界值高于低值），也会失败。详见"
" Copter 的 :ref:`failsafe-battery`、Plane 的 :ref:`apms-failsafe-function` 或 "
"Rover 的 :ref:`rover-failsafes`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:371
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:407
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:425
#: 0da16d6a596f456e8b8c9c8af5b1a470 470a892ee15042b5b615beecb688a154
#: 75024eec85c54d8ebf21ebc84a73f53c f4cf34bbdc504f42a4c8b80a3b78f379
msgid ""
"In addition, minimum arming voltage and remaining capacity parameters for "
"each battery/power monitor can be set, for example "
":ref:`BATT_ARM_VOLT<BATT_ARM_VOLT>` and :ref:`BATT_ARM_MAH<BATT_ARM_MAH>` "
"for the first battery, to provide a check that the battery is not only above"
" failsafe levels, but also has enough capacity for operation."
msgstr ""
"此外，可为每个电池/电源监测器设置最低解锁电压和剩余容量参数（例如第一块电池的 :ref:`BATT_ARM_VOLT<BATT_ARM_VOLT>` "
"和 :ref:`BATT_ARM_MAH<BATT_ARM_MAH>`），以确保电池不仅超过失控保护水平，还有足够的飞行容量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:374
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:410
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:428
